This looks like a Caesar salad, with romaine lettuce coated in creamy dressing and possibly a few croutons or cheese. It sits on a square plate about 24 cm wide, and the food covers an area of roughly 10x8 cm plus a small separate piece. It is a thin, loose layer, so I estimate about 80 g of lettuce, with dressing adding about 25 g, for a total of about 105 g.

For energy, the lettuce contributes about 15 kcal. The dressing at about 25 g contributes about 100 kcal at roughly 4 kcal/g. Cheese and croutons add about 30 kcal. That comes to about 145 kcal, and I round it to 150.

